0 BEGIN PGM CAMCRAFT MM
1 BLK FORM 0.1 Z X-20 Y-15 Z-2
2 BLK FORM 0.2 X+20 Y+15 Z+5
3 ; CONFIRM XYZ MODE - QUILL COUPLED - W FIXED
4 ; CONFIRM SPINDLE STOPPED - NO TILT
5 ; CANCEL ACTIVE COORDINATE TRANSFORMATIONS
6 ; CONFIRM QUILL AT UPPER CHANGE POSITION
7 ; VERIFY +Z RETRACT PATH AND CHANGE SPACE
8 ; CHECK FULL-RETRACT XY PATH FOR ALL TOOLS
9 ; VERIFY TOOL TABLE AND PRESET 2
10 ; CHECK PRESET X Y Z FILLED AND ROTATION ZERO
11 M0
12 CYCL DEF 247 DATUM SETTING ~
  Q339=+2
13 M137
14 ; OPERATION Arc contour
15 ; CHECK DRIVES OFF BEFORE TOUCHING TOOL
16 ; CHECK QUILL AT PHYSICAL CHANGE POSITION
17 ; ABORT IF EITHER CHECK FAILS
18 ; THEN INSTALL TOOL 2 FLAT-6
19 M0
20 TOOL CALL 2 Z S3500
21 L M140 MB MAX
22 ; CHECK ACTUAL TIP HEIGHT AND ENTIRE XY PATH
23 ; ABORT IF TOOL OR HOLDER CANNOT CLEAR
24 M0
25 M3
26 M9
27 CYCL DEF 32.0 TOLERANCE
28 CYCL DEF 32.1 T0.02
29 L X+10 Y+0 R0 FMAX
30 L Z+10 R0 FMAX
31 L X+10 Y+0 Z+10 R0 FMAX
32 L X+10 Y+0 Z+4 R0 F120
33 CC X+0 Y+0
34 C X+0 Y+10 DR+ F350
35 CC X+0 Y+0
36 C X+10 Y+0 DR- F350
37 L X+15 Y+0 Z+4 R0 F220
38 L X+15 Y+0 Z+10 R0 FMAX
39 CYCL DEF 32.0 TOLERANCE
40 CYCL DEF 32.1
41 M9
42 M5
43 ; OPERATION Arc contour
44 TOOL CALL 2 Z S3500
45 L M140 MB MAX
46 ; CHECK ACTUAL TIP HEIGHT AND ENTIRE XY PATH
47 ; ABORT IF TOOL OR HOLDER CANNOT CLEAR
48 M0
49 M3
50 M9
51 L X+10 Y+0 R0 FMAX
52 L Z+10 R0 FMAX
53 L X+10 Y+0 Z+10 R0 FMAX
54 L X+10 Y+0 Z+4 R0 F120
55 CC X+0 Y+0
56 C X+0 Y+10 DR+ F350
57 CC X+0 Y+0
58 C X+10 Y+0 DR- F350
59 L X+15 Y+0 Z+4 R0 F220
60 L X+15 Y+0 Z+10 R0 FMAX
61 M9
62 M5
63 M2
64 END PGM CAMCRAFT MM
